      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MUZZAME MATE (4) finished fourth last start, beaten 10 metres at this track over 1680m. Tackles a similar assignment and he can figure in the finish. MIGHT AND TEMERITY (3) scored at this track two runs ago before having her colours lowered when sixth at her latest appearance over 2090m at Hobart, beaten 18 metres. Has the benefit of a good draw. This looks a sterner test than last time but on her best form she is good enough to take this out. IDEN LADY LINCOLN (7) has a strong record here which is significant. Finished last of nine over 2090m at Hobart last time out but finds the right field here to return to to-three form. WEONA EAGLE (1) disappointed last time when finishing last of 10 over 2200m at this track when trying to lead all the way. Having drawn the pole position is worth an each-way ticket.",
